hadiths[count]{hadithnumber,text}:
"2990","Narrated to us Muhammad bin Rafi', Muhammad bin Yahya, and Muhammad bin Sahl, who said: Narrated to us Abdur-Razzaq, who said: Narrated to us Ubaydullah, on the authority of Nafi', from Ibn Umar (RA), who said: \"The Messenger of Allah (ﷺ), Abu Bakr (RA), Umar (RA), and Uthman (RA) would alight at Al-Abtah.\""
"2991","Narrated to us Muhammad ibn Yahya, Muhammad ibn Rafi', and Muhammad ibn Sahl, they said: Narrated to us 'Abd al-Razzaq, he informed us Ma'mar, from Ayyub, from Nafi', from Ibn 'Umar (RA), similar to it.\n\n**CHAPTER:**"
